<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - King Cty Public Hosp No 1, Wash..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - King Cty Public Hosp No 1, Wash..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co said it has received the written award on $29.180 million of King County Public Hospital District No 1, Wash., hospital facilities refunding bonds, series 1997 for Valley Medical Center, with a top yield of 5.63 percent in 2015.</p>
<p>The final pricing follows:</p>
